      {
        "@value": "This Test must take into account the given month and year, if present, to account for leap years. This is part of a group of similar Tests (VALIDATION_DAY_INRANGE (8d787cb5-73e2-4c39-9cd1-67c7361dc02e, #VALIDATION_STARTDAYOFYEAR_INRANGE (85803c7e-2a5a-42e1-b8d3-299a44cafc46), VALIDATION_ENDDAYOFYEAR_INRANGE9a39d88c-7eee-46df-b32a-c109f9f81fb8))."
      }
    ],
